      "text": "Model gateway: the single server-side path for every model call, failing closed when unconfigured rather than falling back to an unauthenticated route (#34).\nSIP-050 scoring engine with strictly validated 0-5 relevance, signal and confidence; rejects any model output that does not match the contract instead of coercing it (#34, #50).\nImported the SIP-185 v1.0 source register from data: 176 sources, 112 mandatory. Re-keyed the coverage gate on source id after finding duplicated names across the NZ and India lists (#27, #35, #51).\nFail-closed run orchestrator: legal transitions only, hard human gates, a terminal stopped state, and an in-memory append-only transition history (the persistent database audit is Phase 2) (#67).",
